Subject: [PATCH] The disc's sectors, for the host

A game whose disc server runs on the host (Transformers: TwoFish native) reads the disc by
LSN through PS2Runtime::readDiscSectors: the same sectors the IOP's CD reads see (the disc
image, or the virtual disc built over a directory), into a host buffer.
---
